  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. minus thirty outside, the aurora's out and the ice is holding. first place. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Polar\n01:55 Hollow Floe\n04:09 Permafrost Approach\n06:22 Overdrive Line\n08:33 Frostbite Sprint\n10:44 Coldstart Drive\n12:58 Downforce Sprint\n15:10 Silent Momentum\n17:24 Black Ice Circuit\n19:38 Aurora\n21:50 Burnout Stage\n24:04 Hoarfrost Sprint\n26:16 Icefield\n28:27 Whiteout Theory\n30:38 Tundra Rush\n32:52 Wheelspin Approach\n35:03 Cold Turbo\n37:16 Sector Three Circuit\n39:30 Glacier\n41:43 Snowblind Rush\n43:56 Boost Theory\n46:09 Lost Kickdown\n48:22 Hidden Nitro\n50:35 High Afterburn\n52:49 Crevasse\n55:02 Sub Zero\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
